; Zone Operations (Mixon) - operation descriptors.
; One section per operation. The engine (zop_*.script) runs any of them; a new operation needs
; a new section here plus its texts (st_zop_<id>_*), no new code.
;
; actor_faction  player's true community (get_actor_true_community)
; giver          story id = character profile of the commander who offers it (dialog is added to him)
; type           assault (clear target smarts one by one) | defense (beat attacker waves at target)
; targets        smart names, in order
; enemy          community that must be cleared (assault) / that attacks (defense)
; ally_squad / ally_count            squads that assault with the player (spawned at the muster smart)
; attacker_squad / attacker_count    defense waves; delay_hours before they arrive
; muster         fixed muster smart (default: picked 150-400 m from the first target)
; flank_count / flank_squad / flank_target / flank_muster
;                two-sided assault: a second group sets out with the first from flank_muster
;                (default: far side of flank_target) and fights at flank_target meanwhile
; radius         metres around a target smart that must be clear
; evacuate       story_squad:smart pairs sent away before the fight (story NPCs never die here)
; capture        true = cleared targets become the faction's (no enemy respawn, garrison kept);
;                on a defense: the target becomes the faction's when the defense succeeds
; garrison_squad / garrison_count    garrison per captured smart
; services       stock squads of the faction's service NPCs that walk in after a capture
;                (trader / mechanic: base jobs take them by name, e.g. dolg_sim_squad_trader)
; services       entries may be section:smart - that squad walks to its own smart
; services_home  captured smart that owns the services (default: the last target)
; services_escort       squad that walks with them and then joins the garrison
; services_delay_hours  hours after the capture before they set out (re-sent a day after they die)
; services_from         smart they start from (default: a smart 250-420 m from the target, then 300-700 m)
; trader_trade          trade file for the traders (the base job's file belongs to the old owner)
; requires       operations that must have succeeded first (chains)
; retake         true = only while the enemy (op.enemy) holds every target (taking a captured place back)
; requires_info  info portion the player must have (story progress, e.g. bar_deactivate_radar_done)
; allies / defender_squad / defender_count   defense: communities that also hold the target, our own squad sent there
; waves          defense in waves "squad:count, squad:count" (the enemy of each wave is its squad's faction);
;                a wave that has not been beaten in 15 real minutes gives up; news text st_zop_<id>_wave<N> from wave 2 on
; wave_spawn_N   the same for wave N only (e.g. wave_spawn_4: the Monolith comes from elsewhere)
; wave_spawn     x,y,z@level_vertex@game_vertex - a fixed spot on the target's level where the defense waves
;                appear (default: a smart 180-450 m from the target); the PDA mark goes to the smart next to it
; occupy_squad / occupy_count   the enemy digs in at every target when the operation starts
; evict          true = everybody else living at the targets moves out when the operation starts
; counter_squad / counter_count / counter_delay_seconds / counter_target
;                after the last target: a countdown (real seconds, default 180), then a counterattack on
;                counter_target (default: the last target); beaten, or not arrived in 10 real minutes = truce
;                (texts st_zop_<id>_counter / _truce)
; requires_days  game days that must pass after the required operations
; release_allies true = our squads go back to the simulation when the operation succeeds
; props          section@x,y,z@yaw objects placed on the services_home level when the operation succeeds
;                (a chair for the mechanic; placeable_* sections go through Hideout Furniture)
; peace_with     communities our faction makes peace with (at least neutral) when the operation starts
; peace_on_success  communities that become our friends when the operation succeeds
; success_spawn  squads that come to the first target when the operation succeeds (a trader and his guard)
; start_news / success_news   text ids (comma separated) sent as news when the operation starts / succeeds
; reinforce_count / reinforce_at / reinforce_max / reinforce_squad
;                our fighters down to reinforce_at (3) or fewer -> reinforce_count squads of reinforce_squad
;                (default: ally_squad / defender_squad) come, at most reinforce_max (3) times per phase
;                (the assault, the counterattack and the defense count separately)
; restore        story_squad:smart pairs sent (back) there when the operation succeeds
; blocks         operations that become unavailable after this one succeeds
; reward_money, goodwill, cooldown_days
;
; texts per operation: st_zop_<id>_name / _offer / _muster / _won / _failed, assault: _go / _next
; (+ _counter / _truce), defense: _attack (+ _wave2 ..), services: _services_go / _services_here

[zop_ops]
list = duty_yanov, freedom_yanov, csky_marsh, army_valley, freedom_garbage, freedom_yanov_retake, freedom_rostok, csky_factory, csky_rostok, csky_jupiter

